{
  "bodyHash": "jerYG1Ri32w=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DS2yJUe.png\" width=\"572\" height=\"349\"></h1><pre style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZapGEPqm2V\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1173075408556654592?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=orange&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=white&amp;color=gray\" alt=\"\" width=\"91\" height=\"23\"></a></pre><pre style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</pre><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>關於</strong></em></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><p><strong>這是 FTBUltimine 的附加模組。此模組的主要理念是將超能挖掘能力鎖定在特定條件下！</strong><br><strong>讓玩家透過完成一些挑戰來獲得挖掘技能，從而使遊戲體驗更有趣。</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>不知從何開始？</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>&nbsp;⟫</strong></span></p><p><strong>這裡是<a href=\"https://github.com/ixDarkLorD/UltimineAddition/wiki#-entry-index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遊玩指南</a>的 Wiki 頁面</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>特色</strong></em></span><span style=\"color:#339\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>鎖定超能挖掘能力</strong><em><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\">（在獲得技能前，你無法使用超能挖掘）</span></strong></em></li>\n<li><strong>超過 80+ 項挑戰 <span style=\"color:#808080\"><em>（誰不喜歡挑戰呢 :)）</em></span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong>進度顯示&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em>（你可以將任何挑戰釘選在畫面上）</em></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><strong>自訂挑戰 <em><span style=\"color:#808080\">（你可以透過資料包新增挑戰，並指定其歸屬類別）</span></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong>自訂卡片 API&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em>（你可以透過設定檔新增自訂卡片。更多資訊請查閱<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>）</em></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 整合<em>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\">（此模組與 JEI 相容，顯示如何開始進行）</span></em></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a> 整合&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em>（你可以將技能記錄放入 Curios/Trinkets 選單中）</em></span></strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>設定</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>&nbsp;⟫</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"color:#808080\"><strong>「設定檔中有許多選項可供選擇」</strong></span></em></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>此模組有兩種方式取得礦工證書...「多層挑戰」或「單一挑戰」來完成。</strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>即將推出的功能</strong></em></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>筆升級</strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong>依賴項&nbsp;</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Architectury API</strong></span></a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>（必備）</strong></em></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/coolcatlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoolCatLib</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>（必備）</strong></em></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-ultimine-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Ultimine</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#808080\"><em><strong>（必備）</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong> 翻譯&nbsp;</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><p><strong>你可以前往專案的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fultimine-addition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin 連結</a>來協助翻譯！</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><em><strong>支援語言：</strong></em></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#669\"><em><strong>英文</strong></em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#669\"><em><strong>阿拉伯文</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong> 更多建議&nbsp;</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>如果你有任何關於未來更新應加入的點子，請毫不猶豫地在<a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://github.com/ixDarkLorD/UltimineAddition/labels/enhancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>頁面上寫下你的想法！我會非常感激。</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟪</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\"><em><strong> 常見問題&nbsp;</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\"><strong>⟫</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>我可以在我的模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#333\"><em><strong>當然！你可以自由使用。</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>我可以在其他網站上重新發布這個模組嗎？</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#333\"><em><strong>不行！讓我們理智點。這就像你辛苦創作的東西最後被人偷走一樣！</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAb7jXE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1229\" height=\"12\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
